WEBVTT

00:00:57.762 --> 00:01:00.640
is that yeast is normally
found in the vagina.

00:01:00.681 --> 00:01:03.059
At some point in a given year,

00:01:03.101 --> 00:01:06.437
one study estimates
that 70 percent of people

00:01:06.479 --> 00:01:08.147
will have yeast in their vagina,

00:01:08.189 --> 00:01:11.901
just hanging out in the microbiome
and causing no symptoms.

00:01:11.943 --> 00:01:16.239
And secondly, sugar is normally
found in the vagina.

00:01:16.280 --> 00:01:19.784
After all, that's what also feeds
the good bacteria.

00:01:19.784 --> 00:01:24.247
It's the overgrowth of this yeast
that's already there

00:01:24.288 --> 00:01:25.456
that produces symptoms

00:01:25.498 --> 00:01:28.543
and results in what we call
a yeast infection.

00:01:28.543 --> 00:01:31.337
One theory for the sugar-yeast connection